'''Ice Doge''' (アイスわんこ, ''Aisu Wanko'', '''Ice Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]].

