==Enemy==
This enemy is similar to [[Wall Doge]], but has slightly higher stats.

==Strategy==
This enemy acts as the shield for other enemies with strong attack power such as [[Le'mammoth]]. Ice Doge often appears in group of 5 or 6 (excluding [[Langue de Chat]]) and their strength magnification is not really high (100% or 200%). Strong [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] can take them out easily.

